Xiao. Mr. Shanglue Xiao and Mr. Shangce Xiao are PRC citizens. Our WFOE has entered into a series of contractual arrangements with the
VIE (i.e., Yunji Preferred) and its shareholders, which enable us to:</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

