                                            video that showcases the product and consider whether to make the purchase. In addition to
                                            the attractive price, the app also offers features to encourage the member to recommend his/her
                                            family, friends or other social contacts to purchase our products. In the product listings,
                                            the member can see the amount of incentives he/she will earn if someone purchases products
