and content of quarterly reports and proxy statements. Our officers, directors are exempt from the short-swing profit recovery provisions
contained in Section 16 of the Exchange Act. and our principal shareholders are exempt from the reporting and short-swing profit recovery
provisions contained in Section 16 of the Exchange Act.</span></p>

