<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Pursuant
to the Spousal Consent Letters, each Nominee Shareholder, who is a natural person, and his or her spouse unconditionally and irrevocably
agreed that the equity interests in the VIE held by such Nominee Shareholder will be disposed of pursuant to the equity interest pledge
agreements, the exclusive option agreements, the loan agreement and the proxy agreement and power of attorney. Each of their spouses
agreed not to assert any rights over the equity interests in the VIE held by their respective spouses. In addition, in the event that
any spouse obtains any equity interests in any VIE held by his or her spouse for any reason, he or she agreed to be bound by the contractual
arrangements.</span></p>

