<span id="xdx_864_zuf4ljpS0Tp3">Inventories, net</span></i></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b><i>&#160;</i></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Inventories,
consisting of products available for sale, are stated at the lower of cost and net realizable value. Cost of inventory is determined
using the weighted average cost method. Adjustments are recorded to write down the cost of inventory to the estimated net realizable
value due to slow-moving merchandise and damaged goods, which is dependent upon factors such as historical and forecasted consumer demand,
and promotional environment. Write downs of RMB <span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--InventoryWriteDown_pn3n3_uRMB_c20230101__20231231_zrDPRIeruzl7" title="Inventory write down"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InventoryWriteDown" contextRef="From2023-01-012023-12-31" id="Fact001560" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="RMB">9,270</ix:nonFraction></span>, RMB <span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--InventoryWriteDown_pn3n3_uRMB_c20240101__20241231_z0si2HLcVEP8" title="Inventory write down"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InventoryWriteDown" contextRef="From2024-01-012024-12-31" id="Fact001562" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="RMB">12,722</ix:nonFraction></span> and RMB <span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--InventoryWriteDown_pn3n3_uRMB_c20250101__20251231_zvjY0rtczuNc" title="Inventory write down"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InventoryWriteDown" contextRef="From2025-01-01to2025-12-31" id="Fact001564" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="RMB">3,427</ix:nonFraction></span> are recorded in cost of revenues in the Consolidated
Statements of Comprehensive Loss for the years ended December 31, 2023, 2024 and 2025, respectively.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>&#160;</b></span></p>

