<span id="xdx_865_zucOwVfozQM1">General and administrative</span></i></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">General
and administrative expenses consist of payroll costs including share-based compensation expenses and other expenses which are related
to the general corporate functions, including accounting, finance, tax, legal and human relations, costs associated with use by these
functions of facilities and equipment, such as depreciation and amortization expenses, rental and other general corporate related expenses.</span></p>

