  <td style="text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F1F_zgI195ztxIAj" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001834" xml:lang="en-US">In June 2021, the Group entered
  into a purchase agreement with a third-party company to purchase an office building. The Group paid<span id="xdx_90B_ecustom--PercentageOfConsiderationPaidForAssetAcquisition_pid_dp_uPure_c20210101__20211231__us-gaap--PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis__srt--OfficeBuildingMember__us-gaap--AssetAcquisitionAxis__us-gaap--SeriesOfIndividuallyImmaterialAssetAcquisitionsMember_zunvZowk99yj" title="Percentage of consideration paid for asset acquisition" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIFBST1BFUlRZIEVRVUlQTUVOVCBBTkQgU09GVFdBUkUgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"> <ix:nonFraction name="YJ:PercentageOfConsiderationPaidForAssetAcquisition" contextRef="From2021-01-012021-12-31_srt_OfficeBuildingMember_us-gaap_SeriesOfIndividuallyImmaterialAssetAcquisitionsMember" id="Fact001836" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">50</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the total amount with consideration
  of RMB <span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--AssetAcquisitionConsiderationTransferred_pn3n3_c20210101__20211231__us-gaap--PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis__srt--OfficeBuildingMember__us-gaap--AssetAcquisitionAxis__us-gaap--SeriesOfIndividuallyImmaterialAssetAcquisitionsMember_zaCkrO9aau4k" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIFBST1BFUlRZIEVRVUlQTUVOVCBBTkQgU09GVFdBUkUgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AssetAcquisitionConsiderationTransferred" contextRef="From2021-01-012021-12-31_srt_OfficeBuildingMember_us-gaap_SeriesOfIndividuallyImmaterialAssetAcquisitionsMember" id="Fact001837" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="RMB">81,125</ix:nonFraction></span> in 2021 and paid the remaining <span id="xdx_90C_ecustom--PercentageOfConsiderationPaidForAssetAcquisition_pid_dp_uPure_c20220101__20221231__us-gaap--PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis__srt--OfficeBuildingMember__us-gaap--AssetAcquisitionAxis__us-gaap--SeriesOfIndividuallyImmaterialAssetAcquisitionsMember_zEpHDayz1bG8" title="Percentage of consideration paid for asset acquisition" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIFBST1BFUlRZIEVRVUlQTUVOVCBBTkQgU09GVFdBUkUgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="YJ:PercentageOfConsiderationPaidForAssetAcquisition" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_srt_OfficeBuildingMember_us-gaap_SeriesOfIndividuallyImmaterialAssetAcquisitionsMember" id="Fact001839" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">50</ix:nonFraction></span>% in amount of RMB <span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--AssetAcquisitionConsiderationTransferred_pn3n3_c20220101__20221231__us-gaap--PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis__srt--OfficeBuildingMember__us-gaap--AssetAcquisitionAxis__us-gaap--SeriesOfIndividuallyImmaterialAssetAcquisitionsMember_zispOEQDXdR9" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIFBST1BFUlRZIEVRVUlQTUVOVCBBTkQgU09GVFdBUkUgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AssetAcquisitionConsiderationTransferred" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_srt_OfficeBuildingMember_us-gaap_SeriesOfIndividuallyImmaterialAssetAcquisitionsMember" id="Fact001840" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="RMB">80,732</ix:nonFraction></span> in 2022. In June 2022, the new office building has been delivered
  by the third-party company to the Group and all prepayment except for the value added tax of the office building were recorded as construction
  in progress upon delivery in 2022. In April 2023, the office building has been put into use with estimated useful life of <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--PropertyPlantAndEquipmentUsefulLife_iI_dtY_c20230403__us-gaap--PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis__srt--OfficeBuildingMember__us-gaap--AssetAcquisitionAxis__us-gaap--SeriesOfIndividuallyImmaterialAssetAcquisitionsMember_zczSHxAsMX3j" title="Property plant and equipment estimated useful life" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIFBST1BFUlRZIEVRVUlQTUVOVCBBTkQgU09GVFdBUkUgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2023-04-03_srt_OfficeBuildingMember_us-gaap_SeriesOfIndividuallyImmaterialAssetAcquisitionsMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact001842" name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentUsefulLife">40</ix:nonNumeric></span> years.</ix:footnote></span></td></tr>

