Investments in limited liability companies are individually immaterial for the periods presented. The Group recorded losses of RMB <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--IncomeLossFromEquityMethodInvestments_iN_pn3n3_di_c20230101__20231231_zVdJ5NTEuv3j" title="Equity in loss of affiliates, net of tax"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:IncomeLossFromEquityMethodInvestments" contextRef="From2023-01-012023-12-31" id="Fact001912" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" sign="-" unitRef="RMB">7,276</ix:nonFraction></span>,
RMB <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--IncomeLossFromEquityMethodInvestments_iN_pn3n3_di_c20240101__20241231_zmef5O2YDQJe" title="Equity in loss of affiliates, net of tax"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:IncomeLossFromEquityMethodInvestments" contextRef="From2024-01-012024-12-31" id="Fact001914" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" sign="-" unitRef="RMB">5,061</ix:nonFraction></span> and an income of RMB <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--IncomeLossFromEquityMethodInvestments_pn3n3_c20250101__20251231_z1Qa1smuxvS7" title="Equity in loss of affiliates, net of tax"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:IncomeLossFromEquityMethodInvestments" contextRef="From2025-01-01to2025-12-31" id="Fact001916" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="RMB">3,608</ix:nonFraction></span> of its proportionate share of equity investee&#8217;s earnings or net loss in equity in (loss)/income
