<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>10.
LONG-TERM INVESTMENTS (CONTINUED)</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><i>(b)</i></span> <span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><i><span style="text-decoration: underline">Equity securities accounted for under measurement alternative</span></i></span></p>



<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
investments accounted for under measurement alternative mainly represent the Group&#8217;s equity investment over which the Group is
not able to exercise significant influence in the form of ordinary shares of the investee and investment in a limited partnership fund
as a limited partner with minority interest.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">i)
Investment in investee A and the &#8220;Enlarged A Group&#8221;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Group previously accounted for the investment in the investee A using equity method. In 2021, Yunji disposed of the investment in investee
A with a gain and injected the same amount of consideration into the parent holding company of investee A (&#8220;the Enlarged A Group&#8221;).
Since Yunji lost significant influence, the Company recorded the new investment in the Enlarged A Group under alternative measurement.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-indent: 0pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-indent: 0pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">As
of December 31, 2025, <b style="font-style: normal; font-weight: normal">the carrying amount of this investment</b> was RMB <span id="xdx_90D_ecustom--InvestmentMethodCarryingAmount_iI_pn3n3_c20251231_zhrdAjbeiyUj" title="Carrying amount of this investment"><ix:nonFraction name="YJ:InvestmentMethodCarryingAmount" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-31" id="Fact001918" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="RMB">192,243</ix:nonFraction></span><b>.</b>&#160;For the year ended December 31, 2025,
the Group did not recognize any fair value changes or impairment losses related to this investment, as no observable price changes occurred
and no impairment indicators were identified.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.7pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">ii)
Investment in the limited partnership fund</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.7pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.7pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
investment cost in the limited partnership fund was RMB <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--InvestmentOwnedAtCost_iI_pn3n3_uRMB_c20231231__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--LimitedPartnershipMember_zCksXrJA3nRe" title="Initial investment of fund"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InvestmentOwnedAtCost" contextRef="AsOf2023-12-31_custom_LimitedPartnershipMember" id="Fact001920" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="RMB">19,752</ix:nonFraction></span>
as of December 31, 2023. For the years ended December 31, 2024 and 2025, withdrawals from this fund were RMB <span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromLimitedPartnershipInvestments_pn3n3_uRMB_c20240101__20241231__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--LimitedPartnershipMember_zalYgNUPa0je" title="Amount withdrawn"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromLimitedPartnershipInvestments" contextRef="From2024-01-012024-12-31_custom_LimitedPartnershipMember" id="Fact001922" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="RMB">2,505</ix:nonFraction></span>
and RMB <span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromLimitedPartnershipInvestments_pn3n3_uRMB_c20250101__20251231__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--LimitedPartnershipMember_zJS24GesEqf3" title="Amount withdrawn"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromLimitedPartnershipInvestments" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-12-31_custom_LimitedPartnershipMember" id="Fact001924" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="RMB">2,033</ix:nonFraction></span>,
respectively.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.7pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.7pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">iii)
Impairment of equity securities accounted for under measurement alternative</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">As
of December 31, 2024 and 2025, there were RMB <span id="xdx_902_ecustom--ImpairmentOfInvestment_pn3n3_uRMB_c20240101__20241231_zby1wl4fgdsg" title="Impairment of investments"><ix:nonFraction name="YJ:ImpairmentOfInvestment" contextRef="From2024-01-012024-12-31" id="Fact001926" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="RMB">9,427</ix:nonFraction></span>
and RMB <span id="xdx_909_ecustom--ImpairmentOfInvestment_pn3n3_uRMB_c20250101__20251231_zU9Gixxk1Oa8" title="Impairment of investments"><ix:nonFraction name="YJ:ImpairmentOfInvestment" contextRef="From2025-01-01to2025-12-31" id="Fact001928" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="RMB">9,427</ix:nonFraction></span>
accumulated impairment on these investments, primarily due to business deterioration as a result of macroeconomic
changes.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><i>(c) <span style="text-decoration: underline">Equity
securities with readily determinable fair values</span></i></span></p>



<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><i>&#160;</i></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Investment
in GXG, Tencent and Meituan</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">In
May 2019, the Group purchased <span id="xdx_90D_ecustom--NumberOfEquitySharesWithReadilyDeterminableFairValueAcquiredDuringThePeriod_pid_c20190501__20190531__us-gaap--FinancialInstrumentAxis__custom--EquitySecuritiesWithReadilyDeterminableFairValueMember__srt--ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis__custom--HongkongListedCompanyGxgMember_zPr9S1dcL6Ej" title="Number of equity shares purchased"><ix:nonFraction name="YJ:NumberOfEquitySharesWithReadilyDeterminableFairValueAcquiredDuringThePeriod" contextRef="From2019-05-012019-05-31_custom_EquitySecuritiesWithReadilyDeterminableFairValueMember_custom_HongkongListedCompanyGxgMember" id="Fact001930" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">22,740,000</ix:nonFraction></span> ordinary shares of a Hong Kong listed Company - GXG (1817. HK) - with a total consideration
of US$ <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--PaymentsToAcquireOtherInvestments_pn6n6_c20190501__20190531__us-gaap--FinancialInstrumentAxis__custom--EquitySecuritiesWithReadilyDeterminableFairValueMember__srt--ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis__custom--HongkongListedCompanyGxgMember_z5ip3RWHGOIe" title="Payments to acquire other investments"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireOtherInvestments" contextRef="From2019-05-012019-05-31_custom_EquitySecuritiesWithReadilyDeterminableFairValueMember_custom_HongkongListedCompanyGxgMember" id="Fact001932" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-6" scale="6" unitRef="RMB">13</ix:nonFraction></span> million, and recorded its investment in GXG with initial cost of US$ <span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--PaymentsToAcquireOtherInvestments_pn6n6_uUSD_c20190501__20190531__us-gaap--FinancialInstrumentAxis__custom--EquitySecuritiesWithReadilyDeterminableFairValueMember__srt--ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis__custom--HongkongListedCompanyGxgMember_z1aTQT1R7Wpa" title="Payments to acquire other investments"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireOtherInvestments" contextRef="From2019-05-012019-05-31_custom_EquitySecuritiesWithReadilyDeterminableFairValueMember_custom_HongkongListedCompanyGxgMember" id="Fact001934" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-6" scale="6" unitRef="USD">13</ix:nonFraction></span> million (equivalent to approximately RMB <span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--PaymentsToAcquireOtherInvestments_pn3n3_c20190501__20190531__srt--ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis__custom--HongkongListedCompanyGxgMember_zQ5krHDCqcx" title="Equity securities cost"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireOtherInvestments" contextRef="From2019-05-012019-05-31_custom_HongkongListedCompanyGxgMember" id="Fact001936" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="RMB">89,517</ix:nonFraction></span>).</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">In
February 2021, the Group purchased <span id="xdx_909_ecustom--NumberOfEquitySharesWithReadilyDeterminableFairValueAcquiredDuringThePeriod_pid_c20210201__20210228__us-gaap--FinancialInstrumentAxis__custom--EquitySecuritiesWithReadilyDeterminableFairValueMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--MeituanThreeSixNineZeroHkMember_zKaPnjwFTMS5" title="Number of equity shares purchased"><ix:nonFraction name="YJ:NumberOfEquitySharesWithReadilyDeterminableFairValueAcquiredDuringThePeriod" contextRef="From2021-02-012021-02-28_custom_EquitySecuritiesWithReadilyDeterminableFairValueMember_custom_MeituanThreeSixNineZeroHkMember" id="Fact001938" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">106,600</ix:nonFraction></span> and <span id="xdx_906_ecustom--NumberOfEquitySharesWithReadilyDeterminableFairValueAcquiredDuringThePeriod_pid_c20210201__20210228__us-gaap--FinancialInstrumentAxis__custom--EquitySecuritiesWithReadilyDeterminableFairValueMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--TencentZeroSevenZeroZeroHkMember_zTAkWkEKsU7d" title="Number of equity shares purchased"><ix:nonFraction name="YJ:NumberOfEquitySharesWithReadilyDeterminableFairValueAcquiredDuringThePeriod" contextRef="From2021-02-012021-02-28_custom_EquitySecuritiesWithReadilyDeterminableFairValueMember_custom_TencentZeroSevenZeroZeroHkMember" id="Fact001940" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">55,000</ix:nonFraction></span> ordinary shares of two Hong Kong listed Company- Meituan (3690. HK) and Tencent
(0700. HK) &#8211; with a total consideration of HKD$ <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--PaymentsToAcquireOtherInvestments_pn5n6_uHKD_c20210201__20210228__us-gaap--FinancialInstrumentAxis__custom--EquitySecuritiesWithReadilyDeterminableFairValueMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--TencentAndMeituanMember_zTxI3Tgwcesi" title="Payments to acquire other investments"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireOtherInvestments" contextRef="From2021-02-012021-02-28_custom_EquitySecuritiesWithReadilyDeterminableFairValueMember_custom_TencentAndMeituanMember" id="Fact001942" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="HKD">77.3</ix:nonFraction></span> million (equivalent to approximately RMB <span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--PaymentsToAcquireOtherInvestments_pn3n3_uRMB_c20210201__20210228__us-gaap--FinancialInstrumentAxis__custom--EquitySecuritiesWithReadilyDeterminableFairValueMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--TencentAndMeituanMember_zwbiECFl94kd" title="Payments to acquire investments"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireOtherInvestments" contextRef="From2021-02-012021-02-28_custom_EquitySecuritiesWithReadilyDeterminableFairValueMember_custom_TencentAndMeituanMember" id="Fact001944" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="RMB">65,065</ix:nonFraction></span>).</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">As
of December 31, 2025, the Group formally changed its intention regarding equity securities originally classified as long-term investments,
primarily consisting of Tencent and Meituan, and reclassed these investments to short-term investments (Note 4). The intent has shifted
from the previous long-term strategic holding to a plan to sell these securities on the open market within the next 12 months.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Based
on the market price, the Group re-measured the investments in short-term and long-term at fair value. As of December 31, 2024 and 2025,
fair value of the investments in short-term investment were nil and RMB <span id="xdx_90E_ecustom--EquitySecuritiesWithReadilyDeterminableFairValue_iI_pn3n3_c20251231_zR2WXZyJyjb" title="Short-Term Investments"><ix:nonFraction name="YJ:EquitySecuritiesWithReadilyDeterminableFairValue" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-31" id="Fact001946" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="RMB">40,480</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively, and in long-term investment were RMB <span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--EquitySecuritiesFvNi_iI_pn3n3_c20241231_zpbTEC7itVa6" title="Fair value of investment"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:EquitySecuritiesFvNi" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-31" id="Fact001948" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="RMB">46,576</ix:nonFraction></span>
