<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>(a)
Value added tax (&#8220;VAT&#8221;) and surcharges</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>&#160;</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Group is subject to statutory VAT rate of <span id="xdx_900_ecustom--ValueAddedTaxRatePercent_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20190401__srt--ProductOrServiceAxis__custom--AgriculturalProductsMember__srt--StatementGeographicalAxis__custom--CNMember_z6NBNyxxfghh" title="Value added tax rate percent"><ix:nonFraction name="YJ:ValueAddedTaxRatePercent" contextRef="AsOf2019-04-01_custom_AgriculturalProductsMember_custom_CNMember" id="Fact002272" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">9</ix:nonFraction></span>% since April 1, 2019 for revenues from sales of agricultural products, and <span id="xdx_90A_ecustom--ValueAddedTaxRatePercent_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20190401__srt--ProductOrServiceAxis__custom--OtherProductsMember__srt--StatementGeographicalAxis__custom--CNMember_zQg6inE40Tn4" title="Value added tax rate percent"><ix:nonFraction name="YJ:ValueAddedTaxRatePercent" contextRef="AsOf2019-04-01_custom_OtherProductsMember_custom_CNMember" id="Fact002274" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">13</ix:nonFraction></span>% since April
1,2019 for sales of other products, respectively, in the PRC. The Group is exempted from VAT for revenues from sales of vegetables and
contraceptives.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Group is subject to VAT at the rate of <span id="xdx_907_ecustom--ValueAddedTaxRatePercent_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20190401__srt--ProductOrServiceAxis__custom--LogisticsServicesMember__srt--StatementGeographicalAxis__custom--CNMember_zPbMb3940B75" title="Value added tax rate percent"><ix:nonFraction name="YJ:ValueAddedTaxRatePercent" contextRef="AsOf2019-04-01_custom_LogisticsServicesMember_custom_CNMember" id="Fact002276" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">9</ix:nonFraction></span>% since April 1, 2019 for the logistics services and<span id="xdx_905_ecustom--ValueAddedTaxRatePercent_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20190401__srt--ProductOrServiceAxis__us-gaap--ServiceOtherMember__srt--StatementGeographicalAxis__custom--CNMember_zjrx3I2TGLta" title="Value added tax rate percent"> <ix:nonFraction name="YJ:ValueAddedTaxRatePercent" contextRef="AsOf2019-04-01_us-gaap_ServiceOtherMember_custom_CNMember" id="Fact002278" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">6</ix:nonFraction></span>% for revenues from other services.</span></p>

