as tax deductible expenses. The additional deduction of <span id="xdx_907_ecustom--AdditionalDeductionOfResearchAndDevelopmentExpensesPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20230101__20231231__us-gaap--IncomeTaxAuthorityNameAxis__us-gaap--StateAdministrationOfTaxationChinaMember_zuRjux0s2QOc" title="Additional deduction of research and development expenses percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="YJ:AdditionalDeductionOfResearchAndDevelopmentExpensesPercentage" contextRef="From2023-01-012023-12-31_us-gaap_StateAdministrationOfTaxationChinaMember" id="Fact002308" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">100</ix:nonFraction></span>% of qualified research and development expenses can be directly claimed in
the annual EIT filing.</span></p>

