a finder&#8217;s commission of US$<span id="xdx_90E_ecustom--FindersCommission_pn3n3_uUSD_c20180201__20180228__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--SeriesBPreferredStockMember_zie7jsHM7oee" title="Finders commission"><ix:nonFraction name="YJ:FindersCommission" contextRef="From2018-02-012018-02-28_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember" id="Fact002623" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">2,000</ix:nonFraction></span> (RMB <span id="xdx_90E_ecustom--FindersCommission_pn3n3_c20180201__20180228__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--SeriesBPreferredStockMember_zpluHN7ZR1mb" title="Finders commission"><ix:nonFraction name="YJ:FindersCommission" contextRef="From2018-02-012018-02-28_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember" id="Fact002625" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="RMB">12,600</ix:nonFraction></span> equivalent). The Company paid <span id="xdx_908_ecustom--PaymentOfFindersCommissionPercent_pid_dp_uPure_c20180601__20180630__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--SeriesBPreferredStockMember_zLxmWRTF9csl" title="Finders commission payment percent"><ix:nonFraction name="YJ:PaymentOfFindersCommissionPercent" contextRef="From2018-06-012018-06-30_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember" id="Fact002627" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">50</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the commission in cash amounted US$<span id="xdx_901_ecustom--PaymentOfFindersCommissionValue_pn3n3_uUSD_c20180601__20180630__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--SeriesBPreferredStockMember_zuw18UFfOw7g" title="Finders commission payment value"><ix:nonFraction name="YJ:PaymentOfFindersCommissionValue" contextRef="From2018-06-012018-06-30_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember" id="Fact002629" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">1,000</ix:nonFraction></span> and
